{"body":{"branch_id":"B2","constraint_refs":[{"id":"record:sha256:5cd8e98fce09ce65555018c1603e0ca13338f827ae649e45d99fbf4c1f0a664e","kind":"constraint","required":true,"schema_version":"eidomancer.record.schema.v0.2"},{"id":"record:sha256:f86741b38d0e7389442cfe21a02e550c47cf13d6a2de30641f91c47ee3522e29","kind":"constraint","required":true,"schema_version":"eidomancer.record.schema.v0.2"},{"id":"record:sha256:c86e7aa7975793289b0e8307b22a48856332fad7a8b8aa7e8d4190dfa120d612","kind":"constraint","required":true,"schema_version":"eidomancer.record.schema.v0.2"}],"creator_operation_ref":{"id":"record:sha256:212adc18fbf6d904d20fdcdb25267d0bde938a23acf29915498b8b908eac21c7","kind":"operation","required":true,"schema_version":"eidomancer.record.schema.v0.2"},"description":"During an attempted coordinated redistribution, one amber crawler crosses the open passage from the amber chamber into the blue chamber first. The plan is for a blue crawler to make its permitted crossing in the opposite direction before the shutter is closed, producing a balanced exchange. Instead, the shutter is closed after the amber crawler has crossed but before any blue crawler leaves the blue chamber. Closure is irreversible, so the intended reciprocal crossing can no longer occur. The amber chamber is left with one amber crawler and no blue crawlers, while the blue chamber contains the transferred amber crawler together with both blue crawlers. The failure therefore creates an asymmetric stranded distribution: three inhabitants are isolated on the blue side and one on the amber side. Because the passage can no longer be traversed, the inhabitants cannot repair the imbalance by completing the original exchange. Adaptation must occur separately within the two chambers. The lone amber crawler in the amber chamber must operate without another inhabitant there, while the transferred amber crawler must coexist with both blue crawlers in the blue chamber. The mistimed closure thus converts what was intended as a reversible-in-progress redistribution into a permanent division whose consequences are determined by the locations reached at the instant the shutter closed.","facts":{"amber_in_amber":1,"amber_in_blue":1,"blue_in_amber":0,"blue_in_blue":2,"shutter_closed":true},"intelligence_response_ref":{"id":"record:sha256:59d6bfbe84b68d812dcfce5f0f754ba1a7f92465875fca84e8cc3c37f97548c6","kind":"intelligence_response","required":true,"schema_version":"eidomancer.record.schema.v0.2"},"rule_set_ref":{"id":"record:sha256:33b4243020f95b36a1ab0d29a4081d31032ae66f77116f5adca7fefee17ddee3","kind":"rule_set","required":true,"schema_version":"eidomancer.record.schema.v0.2"},"seed_ref":{"id":"record:sha256:a601479013f993d6bec16194f2c79fa257fdd59d14e70f9a910d50196745781d","kind":"seed","required":true,"schema_version":"eidomancer.record.schema.v0.2"}},"canonicalization_version":"eidomancer.jcs.v1","claim_class":"generated_candidate","kind":"world_state","provenance":{"actor_role":"environment","identification_status":"declared","input_refs":[{"id":"record:sha256:212adc18fbf6d904d20fdcdb25267d0bde938a23acf29915498b8b908eac21c7","kind":"operation","required":true,"schema_version":"eidomancer.record.schema.v0.2"},{"id":"record:sha256:59d6bfbe84b68d812dcfce5f0f754ba1a7f92465875fca84e8cc3c37f97548c6","kind":"intelligence_response","required":true,"schema_version":"eidomancer.record.schema.v0.2"}],"model_or_version":"fictional.generic.v1","provider":"eidomancer"},"refs":[{"id":"record:sha256:212adc18fbf6d904d20fdcdb25267d0bde938a23acf29915498b8b908eac21c7","kind":"operation","required":true,"schema_version":"eidomancer.record.schema.v0.2"},{"id":"record:sha256:33b4243020f95b36a1ab0d29a4081d31032ae66f77116f5adca7fefee17ddee3","kind":"rule_set","required":true,"schema_version":"eidomancer.record.schema.v0.2"},{"id":"record:sha256:59d6bfbe84b68d812dcfce5f0f754ba1a7f92465875fca84e8cc3c37f97548c6","kind":"intelligence_response","required":true,"schema_version":"eidomancer.record.schema.v0.2"